      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the API Call**\n\nI'm currently focused on defining the API call. I've decided to use Google Cloud's Vertex AI for the hosted LLM. The next step is to make it identifiable in the code.\n\n\n**Implementing the Function**\n\nI'm now writing the `extract_json.py` file. My goal is to define a function to call Vertex AI. I plan to use the `google-cloud-aiplatform` library to make the API call. This function will take text as input, use the LLM to extract JSON, and then return the structured data.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819435865,
          "start": 1789819433492
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b98d3214001kEsxDZzqo7l516",
